---
const platforms = [
  [
    'website',
    'Website and domain',
    'Find out who manages your website and who owns your domain name. Invite us as a named user with only the permissions we agree on. Ownership and billing stay with you.',
    '',
  ],
  [
    'analytics',
    'Google Analytics',
    'Whoever manages your Google Analytics can add our team member to the right property. We will confirm which property and which role before you send the invitation.',
    'https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/9305788',
  ],
  [
    'crm',
    'CRM, pipeline, and booking',
    'Ask the account owner to invite our named contact. We will confirm together who owns pipeline stages, lead routing, and the calendar, and which test records we can use. Please do not upload customer records here.',
    '',
  ],
  [
    'meta',
    'Facebook and Instagram ads (Meta)',
    'The admin of your Meta Business portfolio confirms the Page, Instagram account, ad account, and pixel we need. Use the partner access we give you during onboarding, with only the permissions the work needs.',
    'https://www.facebook.com/help/289207354498410/',
  ],
  [
    'google',
    'Google Ads',
    'Open “Access and security” in your Google Ads account. The admin invites the email we give you, or approves our manager account link, with only the access the work needs.',
    'https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/6372672/manage-access-to-your-google-ads-account',
  ],
  [
    'shopify',
    'Shopify or your online store',
    'Review the collaborator request from our partner account and confirm the store permissions it asks for. Use your store’s user settings. Never share the owner login.',
    'https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/your-account/users',
  ],
  [
    'email',
    'Email and text messaging',
    'Invite our team member in your email or texting platform. We will confirm the sending domain, the sender name, and your existing permission records with you. Please do not paste contact lists into this website.',
    '',
  ],
];
---

<section class="section wrap" id="access-planner">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Your access checklist</p>
      <h2>See what we will need from you.</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      This checklist stays on this page. It does not connect any accounts or
      save passwords. It just helps you find the account owners before we start.
    </p>
  </div>
  <form id="access-planner-form" class="form-card">
    <div class="form-grid">
      <label class="field">
        Your plan
        <select name="engagement">
          <option>Foundation</option>
          <option selected>Growth Partner</option>
          <option>Scale</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label class="field">
        Type of business
        <select name="model">
          <option value="service">Services and appointments</option>
          <option value="ecommerce">Online store</option>
        </select>
      </label>
    </div>
    <fieldset>
      <legend>Which accounts are part of your plan?</legend>
      <div class="platform-picks">
        {platforms.map(([key, name]) => (
          <label class="checkbox-field">
            <input
              type="checkbox"
              name="platform"
              value={key}
              checked={['website', 'analytics', 'crm'].includes(key)}
            />
            {name}
          </label>
        ))}
      </div>
    </fieldset>
    <button class="button" type="submit">
      Build my checklist →
    </button>
    <p class="form-status" role="status"></p>
  </form>
  <div id="access-checklist" hidden tabindex="-1">
    <h3>Your checklist</h3>
    <p class="small">
      Tick an item once the access is actually granted. We double-check
      everything on our side before we set your start date.
    </p>
    {platforms.map(([key, name, body, url]) => (
      <details class="access-item" data-platform={key}>
        <summary>
          {name}
          <span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p>{body}</p>
        {url && (
          <a
            class="text-link"
            href={url}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            How to do this (official help page) ↗
          </a>
        )}
        <label class="checkbox-field">
          <input type="checkbox" data-access-ready={key} />
          Access is granted and we know who owns this account.
        </label>
      </details>
    ))}
    <label class="checkbox-field">
      <input type="checkbox" data-access-ready="scope" />
      The plan, fees, and priorities are agreed and signed.
    </label>
    <label class="checkbox-field">
      <input type="checkbox" data-access-ready="assets" />
      Logo, approved offers, business goals, and any example ads are ready.
    </label>
    <label class="checkbox-field">
      <input type="checkbox" data-access-ready="owner" />
      We know who makes decisions and who approves work.
    </label>
    <div
      class="notice"
      id="access-readiness"
      role="status"
      aria-live="polite"
    ></div>
    <div class="button-row">
      <button type="button" class="button secondary" id="print-access">
        Print or save checklist
      </button>
      <a class="text-link" href="mailto:brandon@deadrivermanagement.com">
        Stuck on one of these? Ask us →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script>
  import '../../scripts/growth-onboarding.js';
</script>
